# =============================================================================
# Site Set: [kroener.DIGITAL] Prive Consent
# =============================================================================
# The cookie-consent banner is injected into the page footer by the PHP
# PSR-14 event listener
# OliverKroener\OkPriveConsent\EventListener\InjectBannerScript
# (listening on AfterCacheableContentIsGeneratedEvent), NOT via TypoScript.
#
# This avoids the site-set load-order pitfall: a theme set that re-declares
# `page = PAGE` after this set would otherwise discard a `page.footerData`
# assignment made here.
#
# This set is intentionally (almost) empty. It only exists so a site's
# config.yaml can keep referencing `oliverkroener/ok-prive-consent` under
# `dependencies:`. The banner works even without referencing the set, because
# the event listener is registered through the extension's Services.yaml.
# =============================================================================
